# The TiDB check environment (#121). Contains a password; never commit it.
.env.tidb

# The final documentation's build output. The sources are docs/final/*.md and
# docs/diagrams/*.svg; the PDF beside them is the artefact.
/docs/final/TarpaLink-Final-Documentation.html
/docs/final/toc-pages.json

# A certificate bundle downloaded for a database check. Never a build input.
/tidb-ca.pem
